@startuml
' Use Case Diagram - Investment & Portfolio Management Simulation
' Scope: M1 requirements (US01-US12, BR1-BR8). Local draft - NOT committed.
title Use Case Diagram - Investment & Portfolio Management Simulation

left to right direction

actor Guest as Guest
actor Investor as Investor
actor "Market Data Provider" as MarketData

rectangle "Investment & Portfolio\nManagement Simulation" {
  usecase "Register and Log In\n(US01)" as UC01
  usecase "Receive Virtual Capital\n(US02)" as UC02
  usecase "View Market Prices\n(US03)" as UC03
  usecase "Place Buy Order\n(US04)" as UC04
  usecase "Warn Insufficient Balance\n(US10)" as UC10
  usecase "Place Sell Order\n(US05)" as UC05
  usecase "Set Stop-Loss / Take-Profit\n(US07)" as UC07
  usecase "View Portfolio\n(US06)" as UC06
  usecase "View Transaction History\n(US08)" as UC08
  usecase "View Performance Chart\n(US09)" as UC09
  usecase "Compare with Benchmark\n(US11)" as UC11
  usecase "View Leaderboard\n(US12)" as UC12
}

Guest --> UC01
Investor --> UC01
Investor --> UC03
Investor --> UC04
Investor --> UC05
Investor --> UC06
Investor --> UC07
Investor --> UC08
Investor --> UC09
Investor --> UC11
Investor --> UC12

UC01 ..> UC02 : <<include>>
UC10 ..> UC04 : <<extend>>

MarketData --> UC03 : reference prices
note right of MarketData
  Order fills (UC04, UC05)
  use the same feed (BR3)
end note

footer Scope: M1 (US01-US12, BR1-BR8)
@enduml
